## Model card

- **Name:** Qoder Sonus
- **Short description:** Qoder's proprietary built-in model (announced 2026-09-10), positioned for marathon-length autonomous tasks, complex knowledge work, serious coding, and computer use; served only inside the Qoder product family (no public API).
- **Provider / access:** Qoder (Alibaba) built-in model; Qoder IDE / CLI / JetBrains / Cloud Agents. No public per-token API; credit-multiplier billing (3.2x → 8x after 2026-09-21 recalibration).
- **Release / knowledge:** 2026-09-10; knowledge cutoff not disclosed.
- **IDs:** `qoder/sonus-1.0` (per scaffolded meta); no external model ID confirmed.
- **Context window:** 128,000 tokens (per scaffolded meta; not independently verified).
- **Modalities:** text in/out (per scaffolded meta); marketed computer-use / GUI control.
- **Pricing (as of 2026-10-29):** credit-multiplier only (3.2x → 8x); no per-token price published.
- **Architecture:** proprietary; parameter count, weights, and training undisclosed.

